{
  "slug": "vantage-critical-thinking-plugins",
  "name": "Vantage Critical Thinking Plugins",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Five plugins that add reflective \"why\" layers to any AI output. Philosophy, History, Psychology, Sociology, and Rhetoric — each examines a question from a different vantage point. Includes a loyalty audit capability that detects whether recommendations are optimized for the user or the provider. 60 tools total. Designed to complement domain plugins (legal, finance, product, etc.) by surfacing hidden assumptions, historical precedent, behavioral barriers, power dynamics, and accountability language.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install vantage-critical-thinking-plugins@claude-community` from `peterzan/vantage-plugins`.\n\nCritical thinking plugins for AI-generated output.\n\nFive plugins that add reflective \"why\" layers to any AI output. Philosophy, History, Psychology, Sociology, and Rhetoric — each examines a question from a different vantage point. Includes a loyalty audit capability that detects whether recommendations are optimized for the user or the provider. 60 tools total. Designed to complement domain plugins (legal, finance, product, etc.) by surfacing hidden assumptions, historical precedent, behavioral barriers, power dynamics, and accountability language.",
